---
/** Privacy policy written to the Digital Personal Data Protection Act, 2023 standard. */
import LegalLayout from "~/layouts/LegalLayout.astro";
import { getSettings } from "~/lib/data";
import { isPlaceholder } from "~/lib/compliance";

const settings = await getSettings();
const b = settings.business;
const brand = b.brand_name;
const pending = "to be published before this site goes live";
const officer = isPlaceholder(b.grievance_officer_name) ? undefined : b.grievance_officer_name;
const officerEmail = isPlaceholder(b.grievance_officer_email)
  ? undefined
  : b.grievance_officer_email;
const address = isPlaceholder(b.office_address) ? undefined : b.office_address;
const email = isPlaceholder(b.email) ? undefined : b.email;
---

<LegalLayout
  title={`Privacy policy | ${brand}`}
  description={`What personal data ${brand} collects when you enquire, why, who sees it, and how to exercise your rights.`}
  path="/privacy-policy/"
  heading="Privacy policy"
  lastUpdated="2026-10-18"
>
  <p>
    This policy explains how {brand} handles your personal data when you use this site. It is
    written to meet the Digital Personal Data Protection Act, 2023.
  </p>

  <h2>Who is responsible for your data</h2>
  <p>
    {brand} is the data fiduciary for data collected on this site. Office address:{" "}
    {address ?? pending}. Email: {email ? <a href={`mailto:${email}`}>{email}</a> : pending}.
  </p>

  <h2>What we collect</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Your name and mobile number, and your email address if you choose to give it.</li>
    <li>The project you asked about and which button you used to contact us.</li>
    <li>Campaign information such as the ad or website that brought you here.</li>
    <li>
      The page you sent the form from and the time you sent it. Our customer relationship software
      may also record your IP address and browser type when it receives your enquiry.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Why we collect it</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>To respond to your enquiry by call, SMS, WhatsApp or email.</li>
    <li>To send you updates about the project you asked about.</li>
    <li>
      To understand which of our campaigns are useful, using campaign data rather than your contact
      details.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Legal basis</h2>
  <p>
    We process your data on the basis of your consent. Our forms show a notice above the Send button
    explaining how we will contact you; you give consent by choosing to send the form. We record the
    exact notice wording, its version and the time you sent it.
  </p>

  <h2>Who we share it with</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Our own sales team.</li>
    <li>
      Service providers that store or process data for us, such as our hosting provider and our
      customer relationship software.
    </li>
    <li>The developer of a project, only if you ask us to share your details with them.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>We do not sell your personal data.</p>

  <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
  <p>We keep your data for 12 months from our last contact with you, then delete it.</p>

  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Access the personal data we hold about you.</li>
    <li>Correct or update it.</li>
    <li>Have it deleted.</li>
    <li>
      Withdraw your consent at any time. This does not affect anything done before you withdrew it.
    </li>
    <li>
      Nominate another person to exercise these rights for you in case of death or incapacity.
    </li>
    <li>
      Raise a grievance with us, and then with the Data Protection Board of India if you are not
      satisfied.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>How to exercise your rights</h2>
  <p>
    Write to our grievance officer, {officer ?? `name ${pending}`}, at{" "}
    {officerEmail ? (
      <a href={`mailto:${officerEmail}`}>{officerEmail}</a>
    ) : (
      `an email address ${pending}`
    )}
    . We respond within 30 days.
  </p>

  <h2>Cookies and analytics</h2>
  <p>
    If enabled, we use Google Analytics to measure visits, and Google Ads and the Meta pixel to
    measure our ads. These tools may set cookies. We never send your name, phone number or email
    address to them from your browser. You can block these cookies in your browser settings, or opt
    out using Google's and Meta's ad settings pages.
  </p>
  <p>
    We keep campaign information (such as which ad you clicked) in your browser for the current
    visit only. We never store your name, phone number or email address in your browser.
  </p>

  <h2>Security</h2>
  <p>
    When you submit the form, your details go directly from your browser to our customer
    relationship software over an encrypted connection. This website does not store them. Access to
    them is limited to named people in our team.
  </p>

  <h2>Children</h2>
  <p>This site is not directed at anyone under 18, and we do not knowingly collect their data.</p>

  <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
  <p>We will update the date at the top of this page whenever this policy changes.</p>
</LegalLayout>
